#: config/hazards.py:468
msgid ""
"Wildfires are uncontrolled burns of vegetation, including forests, shrublands, grasslands, "
"savannas, and croplands. Fire Radiative Power (FRP) is a measure of the energy released by a fire"
" in the form of radiation."
msgstr ""
"Les feux de forêt sont des combustions incontrôlées de la végétation, notamment des forêts, des "
"zones arbustives, des prairies, des savanes et des terres cultivées. La puissance radiative du "
"feu (FRP) mesure l’énergie libérée par un incendie sous forme de rayonnement."

#: config/hazards.py:475
msgid ""
"Wildfires are uncontrolled burns of vegetation, including forests, shrublands, grasslands, "
"savannas, and croplands. Fire frequency is obtained from NASA's Fire Information for Resource "
"Management System (FIRMS) and is used as a proxy for fire hazard."
msgstr ""
"Les feux de forêt sont des combustions incontrôlées de la végétation, notamment des forêts, des "
"zones arbustives, des prairies, des savanes et des terres cultivées. La fréquence des incendies "
"provient du système FIRMS (Fire Information for Resource Management System) de la NASA et sert "
"d’indicateur indirect de l’aléa incendie."

